# Dependencies and build outputs
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/coverage
**/.vite
**/.cache
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Git / IDE
.git
.github
.vscode
.idea
**/.DS_Store

# Secrets — never send env files into images
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Local runtime data
**/uploads
**/uploads-test
docker-data
**/*.log
**/npm-debug.log*
**/yarn-error.log*

# Tests and docs not required for image builds
**/tests
**/*.test.ts
**/*.spec.ts
docs
*.md
!README.md

# Frontend can exclude its own Dockerfile noise when building from frontend/
frontend/Dockerfile
backend/Dockerfile
